  "title": "Forecasting North American Trucking Freight Rates for 2026",
  "summary": "Trucking freight rates have been on a rollercoaster in recent years – from the pandemic-era boom to a “freight recession” that followed. As we approach 2026, shippers, carriers, and logistics pros are all wondering what’s next. Will rates finally rebound, or stay stuck in the doldrums?",
